comments.body:
Found this fuzzing and saw the other dupes marked, but it seems like a PR was never accepted and 3.15 is still impacted.

@serhiy-storchaka and @jackfromeast , happy to help get an acceptable fix over the line if that would be useful.  

My only concern is that it seems like there might be disagreement between @picnixz and @serhiy-storchaka about what the preferred fix and result should be.  Do we want to take the extra Py_SIZE calls inside the loop or just bump ob_exports and throw BufferError?
